      max      |   min   |              max               |             min              |          max          |  min  
---------------+---------+--------------------------------+------------------------------+-----------------------+-------
 {3,3,2,4,5,6} | {1,2,3} | {{white,yellow},{pink,orange}} | {{black,red},{green,orange}} | {2.1,3.3,1.8,1.7,1.6} | {1.6}
(1 row)

---END---
